<p class="img-box line-height-none margin-x-neg-2 tablet:margin-x-0 text-center"><a class="tileshop" target="_blank" href="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/core/lw/2.0/html/tileshop_pmc/tileshop_pmc_inline.html?title=Click%20on%20image%20to%20zoom&amp;p=PMC3&amp;id=4759787_rsif20150679-g4.jpg"><img class="graphic zoom-in" src="https://cdn.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/blobs/4944/4759787/036a383ecae1/rsif20150679-g4.jpg" loading="lazy" height="270" width="753" alt="Figure 4."></a></p>
<div class="p text-right font-secondary"><a href="figure/RSIF20150679F4/" class="usa-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open in a new tab</a></div>
<figcaption><p><em>γ</em>H2AX foci (solid lines, dots) and DSB (dashed lines, crosses) number are plotted against time for (<em>a</em>) MDA-MB-468 and (<em>b</em>) MCF7 cells. Experimental data are denoted by markers. The solution of the averaged model (2.8) (lines) was computed using the optimized parameter sets presented in <a href="#RSIF20150679TB1" class="usa-link">table 1</a>. (Online version in colour.)</p></figcaption></figure><section class="tw xbox font-sm" id="RSIF20150679TB2"><h4 class="obj_head">Table 2.</h4>
<div class="caption p"><p><em>A priori</em> assumed quantities used in the fitting of the rate constants defined in <a href="#RSIF20150679TB1" class="usa-link">table 1</a>.</p></div>
<div class="tbl-box p" tabindex="0"><table class="content" frame="hsides" rules="groups">
